          <dt>Ambiguity</dt><dd>Only Iranian-flagged or dark-fleet vessels qualifying while Western insurers refuse = AMBIGUOUS-RESOLVE-AS-NO. PGSA toll-regime vessels count ONLY IF ≥2 of Hormuz Strait Monitor/Lloyd's List/UNCTAD/Windward confirm as independent commercial entities; PGSA self-reporting excluded.</dd>
        </dl>
        <div class="fc-indicators">
